# Adding an agent host or MCP client

Ship **constants + developer config + docs + public landing/hub wiring** in the same change. Do not defer docs or Access-panel snippets. pSEO surfaces (hub, `/agents/{slug}`, agent × channel pages, footer, decision scenarios) must land together — see **web-seo-pseo** and **web-seo-agent-ecosystems** when ecosystems or `/channels/{slug}` copy applies.

| Kind | Examples | Landing seed | Docs section | Developer Access |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **Agent host** | OpenClaw, Hermes, Grok Bot, MausBot, Tucano, Manus | `agents/hosts/{slug}.ts` | `agent-setup-guides/` | openquok-core / CLI skill (not `MCP_CLIENTS`) |
| **MCP client** | Cursor, ChatGPT, Grok Build, OpenCode | `mcps/hosts/{slug}.ts` | `mcp-setup-guides/` | `getMcpClientConfig` + `MCP_CLIENTS` |

Follow **source-project-neutrality** and **company-brand-icons**. **Reference implementations:** MCP — `mcps/hosts/chatgpt.ts`, `cursor.ts`, `warp.ts`; agent host — `agents/hosts/openclaw.ts`, `grok-bot.ts`, `mausbot.ts`; agent × channel pSEO — `agents/channels/hosts/grok-bot.ts` + `agents/channels/index.ts` (kinds: `social.ts`, `directory.ts`; router `channels/general.ts`).

### Copy — ASD-STE100

Write **ASD-STE100 Simplified Technical English** in every user-facing string you add or change for this ship:

- **Landings:** seed fields (hero, hub, meta, workflow, audience, setup steps, FAQ) and agent × channel host copy in `agents/channels/hosts/{slug}.ts`.
- **Docs:** body prose in `agent-setup-guides/{slug}.md` and `mcp-setup-guides/{slug}.md` (steps, callouts, Related blurbs — not OpenAPI-injected API reference tables).

Use short sentences. Put one idea in each sentence. Use active voice. Address the reader as **you**. Use plain words. Do **not** tell the reader that copy follows STE100 or any style guide. Broader pSEO tiers: **web-seo-pseo**.

**No `backend/supabase/db/**`** for agent launches — catalog tags and launch blogs via secret-admin (**C**).

**When editing an existing product,** treat its seed and channel host file as source of truth. Add new one-off facts there, not new essays in this rule.

---

## Identifier contract

One **lowercase kebab-case** slug everywhere: seed `slug`, filenames, docs path, public `/agents/{slug}` (and `/agents/{slug}/{channelSlug}` for agent hosts). MCP: `mcpClient` label must match `MCP_CLIENTS` in `getMcpClientConfig.ts` exactly; set `MCP_CLIENT_DOCS_SLUG[client]`.

**Hero gradient:** append the product name as in `heroTitle` to `LANDING_HERO_TITLE_HIGHLIGHT_WORDS` in `landingHeroTheme.ts` (multi-word labels need the full phrase, e.g. `'Grok Bot'`).

**README (required, same PR):** `assets/readme/agents-mcp/{slug}.svg` (32×32, official mark), icon row link to `https://www.openquok.com/agents/{slug}`, and name in **Agent hosts** or **MCP clients** prose in **Supported Agents & MCP**.

