## A. MCP client

| Step | What |
| --- | --- |
| Icon | `branded-icons.ts` — `icons.{Brand}.name` |
| Access | `getMcpClientConfig.ts`: `MCP_CLIENTS`, `MCP_CLIENT_DOCS_SLUG`, **path + header** auth branches; `getMcpClientConfig.test.ts` |
| Seed | `mcps/hosts/{slug}.ts` → `MCP_LANDING_SEEDS` in `mcps/seeds.ts`. FAQ deltas via `mergeMcpLandingFaqItems` (`faqPatchesByTitle`, etc.). **No top-level** imports of `getMcpClientConfig` or mock configs in seed files (footer init cycle). |
| Mocks | Unions + themes: `mcp-verify-{slug}`, `mcp-install-{slug}`, `mcp-workflow-{slug}`, `mcp-analytics-{slug}`; layout `ide` \| `terminal` \| `cowork` |
| Docs | `mcp-setup-guides/{slug}.md`, index `LinkCard`, `getting-started-for-mcp/setup.md` row. Never under `agent-setup-guides/`. |
| Optional | `onboardingMcpClients.ts`, `getting-started-for-mcp/index.md` when the short list or intro should name the client |

Footer **MCP Integrations** and hub grid follow `mcps/seeds.ts` — do not hand-edit footer slug lists.

