### Channel SEO (every agent host)

Without **`agents/channels/hosts/{slug}.ts`** + **`PUBLIC_AGENT_CHANNEL_HOST_SLUGS`** / **`channelConfigsByHostSlug`** / **`AGENT_CHANNEL_HOSTS`**, `/agents/{slug}` omits **Every Supported Channels** and `/agents/{slug}/{channel}` 404s.

1. `agents/channels/hosts/{slug}.ts` — `buildAgentChannelConfigsForHost` (copy `grok-bot.ts`).
2. Register slug in `PUBLIC_AGENT_CHANNEL_HOST_SLUGS` and maps in `agents/channels/index.ts`.

MCP clients use `mcps/channels/index.ts` — no per-host channel file. Deeper bento/CLI: **add-social-provider-integration**.

